  "description": "In the winter of her thirty-second year, Heejae's husband's mistress became pregnant. \n\nOverwhelmed by shock, Heejae suffered a stillbirth, losing the child she had conceived after a decade with her unfaithful husband. \n\n\"I will never love you, even if I die... even if I'm reborn.\" \n\nShe jumped off the rooftop of her husband's company, and when she opened her eyes, she had returned ten years to the past – to before she met Baek Doyoung, that man. With nothing left but the desire for revenge for her tragically lost child, Heejae heads to a blind date, intent on personally ruining Doyoung's life. However... Doyoung's actions are strangely different from the past, giving her an unfamiliar feeling. A scar on his wrist that the Doyoung she knew didn't have, a face identical to his, yet a gentle demeanor – everything about him is entirely unfamiliar. \n\n\"Who... who exactly is this man?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=849111), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13849928)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/the-way-to-you/list?title_no=10596), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/the-road-to-you/list?title_no=10382), [Spanish](https://www.webtoons.com/es/romance/el-camino-hacia-ti/list?title_no=10602)",
